* text=auto eol=lf

# VENDORED FILES ARE NOT NORMALISED. Cargo verifies each one against .cargo-checksum.json over its
# exact bytes, and several upstream crates ship CRLF. Letting the rule above rewrite line endings
# changes those bytes, so a fresh clone fails checksum verification and presents as a corrupt vendor
# tree rather than as a line-ending setting. Measured 2026-09-23: 38 files would have been rewritten,
# across generic-array, nu-ansi-term and zerocopy.
vendor/** -text
